  "report": {
    "uncertain": [
      "Infinity Punch compounds: 超時空無限拳 / 無限芭蕉実拳 / 無限交差拳 use the settled 無限拳 = 'Infinity Punch' (Super Dimension Infinity Punch, Cluster Infinity Punch, Infinity Cross Punch) instead of Jigoku's 'Super Dimension Mugen Attack' / 'Cluster Mugen Attack'. The existing full-column entries with the game's own English readings ('Super Dimensional MUGEN ATTACK', 'CLUSTER MUGEN ATTACK') and the table's bare 無限拳 = 'Mugen Attack' (Jigoku reuse) now disagree with these; one of the two sides should be unified.",
      "神来無限掌 kept Jigoku / official reading 'Infinite Palm of the Buddha'; story English (dialogue 753:t_066:1, Ozma line) coined 'Divine Infinity Palm'.",
      "ゼーヤＢ３Ｍ “グローム”ＨＡＥＴハンマー: the Japanese typo HAET rendered as HEAT.",
      "Coined (no voice/Jigoku/story source): ソーラー拳 'Solar Punch', 太陽剣 'Solar Sword', 乱舞 'Wild Dance', 無限交差拳 'Infinity Cross Punch', 統合戦術通信管制システム 'Integrated Tactical Comms System', 超精密狙撃 'Ultra-Precision Sniping', 全武装一斉射 'All Weapons Salvo', 衝撃破 'Shockwave', 光線 'Light Beam', ツイン・ゴッドビースト 'Twin God Beast', アブソリュートノヴァビースト 'Absolute Nova Beast'.",
      "Long FMP manufacturer names drop the maker as Jigoku did (Seward Arsenal, Zeya, Geotron); OTO Melara kept as Jigoku did for the Boxer.",
      "Kept current English even where it looks lossy: 超天元突破ダイグレン攻撃 'Tengen Toppa Dai-Gurren' (no 'Super'/'Attack'), グレンブーメラン超銀河大切断 'Gurren Boomerang Great Cut'."
    ],
    "notes": "Short forms: Mono Cutter family, '57mm Boxer'/'76mm Boxer 2', 'SG'/'TT'/'KK Giga Drill Brk.' pattern, 'Demolition Gun GH', '20mm Gatling Zeros'. Voice-matched: Vibration Mine, Moby Dick Anchor, Isaian Bone Bow, One-Shot Reversal Fist, Trinity Attack, Dimension Tunnel Shell, Probability Shift Shell, Demolition Gun, Zeros."
  }
